7. Considering the above facts and circumstances of the case, this Court deems it fit to grant pre-arrest bail to petitioner/accused No.1, subject to the following stringent conditions:
a) In the event of arrest of the petitioner/accused No.1, the petitioner/accused No.1 shall be enlarged on bail on executing a personal bond for a sum of Rs.25,000/-
